WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:04.600
Talk about your day. Get a comic.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.400
Step 1: press the box and add your script (or record a voice note).

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.867
Comimo spots the people in it: three from the cast, two new names.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:18.267
Step 2: Muse Spark retells the day as a chapter, shot by shot.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:20.467
Step 3: new faces. Omar isn't in the cast yet: add him from a photo.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:25.467
SAM 3.1 cuts him out of the photo and Muse Spark writes how he looks.

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:29.800
Muse Image draws his reference sheet, and his sprite waves hello.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.333
The cashier is only a small part: keep them as a one-off.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.933
Step 4: add real photos from the day, if you like.

00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:40.400
A QR code on the last page opens the album.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.267
Step 5: the page is drawn and lettered in a manga layout.

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:49.667
SAM 3.1 checks every face against the cast's sheets; Nour drifted, so she is redrawn.

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:52.200
Same faces in every panel.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:59.000
Step 6: on heavy days, a gentle check-in card. No scores, no advice.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:08.600
One comic a day, all month long.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:11.267
On the last day, the month is bound into a magazine.

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:14.200
Comimo. Talk about your day. Get a comic.
